  storyText: "Dead Hotel\n\nYou hide on the 30th floor of an unfinished hotel, wind howling through empty windows. Mirage: \"We can't run forever.\"\n\nKaz's Arasaka contact is still in your call log.\n\n1. Go back to the Voodoo Boys.\n2. Call Arasaka."
